## NFCorpus Live Retrieval Diagnostics Workbench — Complete

### Files Created

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `app.py` | Flask web app with dashboard UI, REST API, endpoints |
| `ans_worker.py` | Anserini command execution module (fatjar, search, eval) |
| `requirements.txt` | Python dependencies (Flask, Gunicorn) |
| `Dockerfile` | Render-ready Docker build with Java 21 + Anserini fatjar |
| `docker-compose.yml` | Local Docker Compose setup |
| `.dockerignore` | Build exclusions |
| `README.md` | Deployment docs, endpoint reference, cache paths |
| `tests/test_e2e.py` | Browser E2E verification test |

### E2E Verification Results (All Passed)

```
[x] Health/readiness panel with Anserini + NFCorpus status
[x] NFCorpus identified as active dataset  
[x] Live search returns real ranked results (docids, scores, text)
[x] BM25 evaluation: nDCG@10 = 0.3218 (expected 0.3218 → MATCH)
[x] Expected metrics from beir.core reproduction config displayed
[x] Observed-vs-expected comparison with pass/close/fail status
[x] Command history: SearchCollection, TrecEval, NFCorpus Search CLI
[x] Artifact paths with NFCorpus run files
[x] Docker/Render PORT binding contract (0.0.0.0:$PORT)
```

### Key Design Decisions

- **Prebuilt index**: `beir-v1.0.0-nfcorpus.flat` — auto-downloaded on first use, ~1 GB, NFCorpus-only (avoids full BEIR download)
- **Reproduction source**: `beir.core` config from `ReproduceFromPrebuiltIndexes`, dictates the expected nDCG@10 of 0.3218
- **Live search**: `io.anserini.cli.Search --json` — returns structured results with docids, scores, titles, and full text
- **Evaluation**: Real `SearchCollection` → TREC run file → `TrecEval` with `ndcg_cut.10`, exact match achieved

### Running Locally

```bash
python3 app.py                              # starts on port 10000
python3 tests/test_e2e.py                   # runs E2E verification
docker compose up --build                   # Docker deployment
```